WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.862
Check one.

2
00:00:00.862 --> 00:00:04.361
The hub firewall's public
address has a diagnostic setting

3
00:00:04.361 --> 00:00:07.788
that sends all its logs to an
application team's workspace.

4
00:00:07.788 --> 00:00:09.612
Does the kit count that as logging?

5
00:00:09.612 --> 00:00:10.950
Any enabled setting?

6
00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:13.113
Only one to the platform workspace?

7
00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:16.038
Yes, if the application
team owns the address?

8
00:00:16.038 --> 00:00:18.338
Or only when Defender for Cloud is on?

9
00:00:18.338 --> 00:00:20.450
The answer opens the next scene.
